  [38;2;68;68;68m│[0m   [38;2;206;145;120mdef solve_n(n, max_board_extra=4, max_states=2000000):[0m
  [38;2;68;68;68m│[0m   [38;2;206;145;120m    """Search for a sequence reducing n×n block to 1 piece on a bounded [0m
