[38;2;124;124;124mThe inner piece is at a position of a specific color (determined by the inner [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mblock's invariant). The frame pieces are both of the same color (determined by [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mthe frame's invariant, which is (0,0), so any color). The position between the [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mframe pieces has a specific color (determined by its coordinates).[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mFor the construction to work, we need:[0m
